---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Ag Progress Show 2013 | Smokeless Heat Blog" description="This Ag Progress show 2013 was very well attended all the days but on Wednesday the Main St was solid with people.">
  <Header />

  <main class="pt-24">
    <section class="py-16 bg-charcoal text-cream">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
        <p class="text-ember text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] mb-4">Events</p>
        <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl">Ag Progress Show 2013</h1>
      </div>
    </section>

    <article class="py-16 bg-cream">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 space-y-6 text-charcoal/90 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          This Ag Progress show 2013 was very well attended all the days but on Wednesday the Main St was solid with people. Ag Progress 2013 showing the huge number of attendees.
        </p>

        <p>
          We were displaying the Vedolux boilers in our new operational trailer.
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <img src="https://smokelessheat.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/03/photo-2-3-400x400.jpg" alt="Ag Progress Show 2013" class="w-full border border-wood/20" />
          <img src="https://smokelessheat.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/03/photo-1-3-400x400.jpg" alt="Ag Progress Show 2013" class="w-full border border-wood/20" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
